            <description><![CDATA[<p>(Fixed) Hangar Matrix with many pilots: When the matrix was wider than the window, hovering over or clicking a pilot&#x27;s tile could pick a tile several columns away and open its details. It could happen as soon as the matrix opened, after resizing the window or sidebar, or after switching away and back. Highlights and clicks now always land on the tile under your pointer.</p>]]></description>
